    <description>Quick action on a renewal Opportunity (created by RLM_CreateUpdateRenewalOpportunities). Renews the root assets referenced by the opportunity&apos;s lines (OpportunityLineItem.AssetId, mapped to Asset.RootAssetId so bundle components renew with their bundle) through the standard Initiate Renewal action, linking the resulting quote to the opportunity and, when set, its contract, then opens the quote.</description>
